@baseUrl = http://localhost:5077
@ownerToken = AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
@code = REPLACE_ME

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a relay session (credentials are returned only to its creator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions

### Publish a public profile; use a fresh random 32-byte hex credential outside this example
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/Example%20Player/Moogle
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"CharacterFullName":"Example Player","CharacterBackground":"Public biography"}

### Fetch without credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/Example%20Player/Moogle

### Anonymous overwrite is rejected with 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/Example%20Player/Moogle
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Delete using the original credential
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/Example%20Player/Moogle
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Publish a ruleset; copy the response code into @code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dice-systems
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerName":"Example Player","worldName":"Moogle","systemName":"Example Rules","payload":"{\"SystemName\":\"Example Rules\"}"}

### Public download
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dice-systems/{{code}}

### Public version check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dice-systems/{{code}}/version

### Update using the original credential
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dice-systems
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerName":"Example Player","worldName":"Moogle","systemName":"Example Rules","payload":"{\"SystemName\":\"Example Rules\"}","code":"{{code}}"}
